            <Language id="English">
               At the end of the Praises, the deacons chant the hymn “<span class="Coptic">Tenoueh n~cwk</span>” (We follow You) in its standard tune while holding lit candles and proceeding around the church three times.   
            </Language>
         </Comment>
         
         <InsertDocument path="include/praises/TenowehEnsok"/>
